The guides layer (website SEO plan, track A) lands as scaffolding: the
collection, the routes and the gate rules exist, no articles yet.

This file keeps the directory present so Astro's glob loader has a base to read
on a fresh checkout — an empty collection is valid, a missing one is not. Delete
this file once the first guide lands; the directory keeps itself alive after
that.

Layout: src/content/guides/<locale>/<slug>.md, one file per locale per guide,
because the owner ruled that guides are drafted in both languages together.
